working on different versions

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:25.200
of the same data set.

00:23:25.200 --> 00:23:26.658
So one will change
it in one place,

00:23:26.658 --> 00:23:28.590
but not change it in the other.

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:31.370
Or they'll update the data
set, but not the description,

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:32.550
and things like that.

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:34.430
So one of our goals is
to make it really easy

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:36.470
to see when the data
changed, as well

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:37.770
as what changed with the data.

